ማርባን ሀንዳይሳዳ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ሄ ጋላስ ማሳን ባንታ ዎዛና ምንዳይሳዳ፥","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ህንተ፥ ህንተ ዎዛና ምንፍተ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ኤንቲ ታ ማላልስያ ኦሱዋ በእድካ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ታና ፓጭዶሶና፤ ታራ ኤቀትዶሶና።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ታኒ ሄ የለታ ቦላ ኦይታሙ ላይ ሻተታስ፤","poem":1},{"text":"“ኤንቲ ኡባ ዎደ ባንታ ዎዛናን ባልያ አሳታ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ኤንቲ ታ ኦግያ ኤሮኮና” ያጋስ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"ሄሳ ግሾ፥ “ኤንቲ ታ ሸምፖ በሳ ገሎኮና”","poem":1},{"text":"ያጋዳ ታ ሀንቁዋን ጫቃስ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/95.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/96.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/94.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}